		<h1 class="code">404</h1>
		<p>抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移动。</p>
		<div class="cta-row">
			<a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
			<a href="/docs/" class="btn btn-outline">查看文档</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</SiteLayout>
